 "rationale": "Structure = the leaf dataflow of the RTL contract (ot_s81sl_leaf): leafdn bus face -> vp hcpost lane column(s) -> vn_a/vn_b gather hub (hq, broadcast/gather to all 16 lanes) -> vq -> leafup face; side loop vp SRAMs -x_-> vs engine -> vq u/um; vs hub ring vsw / rxsf->rxsb / ve_m<->ve_s around vs. The base already follows that order; this change keeps it and only re-seats cores along it: arm fc120 (fc120/fc80 = DS85 rule: lowest hcpost lane >= 120/80 um above the S face, Tetris sweep off the face with timing-clean spots only), then core_place B34 relocate/swap/flip to fine-tune bit-mm and the H/V cut shortage. No station changes its register count (EQ); no new pin, no re-pin of signed cores (flips only)."
}